					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250330202,
					"content": "有些失误…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250330204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250330204,
					"content": "这种爬山的速度已经很厉害啦。我和奇卡都比不了你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250330205
